"Move to Trash" = "移到回收站";
"\"%@\" can't be moved to the Trash because its volume doesn't have one. Delete it permanently? This can't be undone." = "“%@”无法移到回收站，因为其所在的驱动器没有回收站。要永久删除吗？此操作无法撤销。";
"%d items can't be moved to the Trash because their volume doesn't have one. Delete them permanently? This can't be undone." = "%d 个项目无法移到回收站，因为其所在的驱动器没有回收站。要永久删除吗？此操作无法撤销。";
