"FileFluss is a dual‑panel file manager for macOS that lets you work with local folders and multiple cloud storage accounts side by side. It is built around a left and right panel — copy, move, sync, and compare files between them with a few clicks." = "FileFluss 是一款适用于 Windows 的双面板文件管理器，可让你并排处理本地文件夹和多个云存储账户。它围绕左右两个面板构建——只需单击几下，即可在二者之间复制、移动、同步和比较文件。";
"**Search** (⌘F) — open the search window." = "**搜索**（Ctrl+F）——打开搜索窗口。";
"Right‑click the toolbar and choose *Customize Toolbar…* to rearrange or hide buttons." = "将鼠标悬停在工具栏按钮上，大多数按钮都会显示简短说明。";
"Open **Settings → Cloud Accounts** (⌘,)." = "打开 **设置 → 云账户**（Ctrl+,）。";
"Sign in via the provider's authentication flow. FileFluss stores the tokens securely in your macOS Keychain." = "通过服务商的认证流程登录。FileFluss 会将令牌存储在 Windows 凭据存储中，并针对你的 Windows 用户账户加密。";
"In **Settings → Cloud Accounts**, click the trash icon next to the account." = "在 **设置 → 云账户** 中，单击账户旁边的 **移除**。";
"Click **Search** in the toolbar, or press **⌘F**." = "单击工具栏中的 **搜索**，或按 **Ctrl+F**。";
"Click the round X close button, press **Esc**, or click the red traffic‑light button." = "单击圆形的 X 关闭按钮、按 **Esc**，或单击窗口的关闭按钮。";
"**Double‑click** any file. Word documents open in Word, PDFs in Preview, images in your image viewer, and so on." = "**双击** 任意文件。Word 文档会在 Word 中打开，PDF 在你的 PDF 阅读器中打开，图像在“照片”应用中打开，依此类推。";
"Could not mount in Finder" = "无法映射为网络驱动器";
"Reveal in Finder" = "在文件资源管理器中显示";
"Open this account as a drive in Finder" = "将此账户映射为网络驱动器";
"Each cloud account you mount in Finder keeps recently-downloaded files locally up to this size, so re-opening the same file is instant. New value applies to the next mount." = "每个映射为网络驱动器的云账户会在本地保留最近下载的文件，上限为此大小，以便再次打开同一文件时即时完成。新值将在下次映射驱动器时生效。";
"Eject this drive from Finder" = "断开此网络驱动器";
"Finder-Mount Read Cache" = "网络驱动器读取缓存";
"Mount in Finder" = "映射为网络驱动器";
"macOS / Finder Style" = "Windows / 文件资源管理器风格";
"Open in Finder" = "在文件资源管理器中打开";
"Do you want to mount “%@” in Finder?" = "是否要将“%@”映射为网络驱动器？";
"This account isn't mounted yet. Mounting it adds it as a drive in Finder so you can open this item there." = "此账户尚未映射为网络驱动器。映射后，它会作为驱动器出现在文件资源管理器中，以便你在那里打开此项目。";
"Mount this account in Finder first — a cloud folder has no path a terminal can open." = "请先将此账户映射为网络驱动器——云端文件夹没有终端可以打开的路径。";
"A terminal can only open a folder that exists on this Mac. Mounting this account adds it as a drive in Finder, and the terminal opens inside it." = "终端只能打开这台电脑上存在的文件夹。将此账户映射为网络驱动器后，它会出现在文件资源管理器中，终端将在其中打开。";
"2. Open DevTools (⌥⌘I in Chrome/Safari/Firefox)" = "2. 打开开发者工具（Chrome/Edge/Firefox 中按 F12）";
"Click Connect to sign in with your Box account. Your browser will open for authentication. Uploads are capped at 50 MB per file in this version." = "单击“连接”以登录你的 Box 账户。你的浏览器将打开以进行认证。";
"FileFluss reads the key file once and stores its contents in the macOS Keychain — moving or deleting the original file later won't affect this account." = "FileFluss 只读取一次密钥文件，并将其内容存储在 Windows 凭据存储中，针对你的用户账户加密——之后移动或删除原始文件不会影响此账户。";
"FileFluss uses your Mac's existing iCloud sign-in — no password needed here. iCloud Drive must be turned on in System Settings → Apple Account → iCloud → iCloud Drive." = "FileFluss 使用 Windows 版 iCloud——此处无需密码。请从 Microsoft Store 安装 Windows 版 iCloud，使用你的 Apple 账户登录并开启 iCloud 云盘。";
"iCloud uses your Mac's system sign-in — there's nothing to edit here. Manage iCloud Drive in System Settings → Apple Account → iCloud." = "iCloud 使用 Windows 版 iCloud 的登录——此处无可编辑内容。请在 Windows 版 iCloud 应用中管理 iCloud 云盘。";
"Jottacloud has no public API, so FileFluss uses the same interface as the official command-line tool. The token is exchanged for a login that's stored in your keychain." = "Jottacloud 没有公开 API，因此 FileFluss 使用与官方命令行工具相同的接口。令牌将被兑换为登录凭据，并加密存储在 Windows 凭据存储中。";

